Portions of this software are derived from OpenCV
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv), included in this repository as a git
submodule at src/OpenCV and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

In particular, the managed contour-detection implementation under
src/Geometrikal.OpenCV.Managed/ImgProc/Contours/ is a C# port of
the OpenCV implementation in:

  - modules/imgproc/src/contours_new.cpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/contours_common.hpp / contours_common.cpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/contours_approx.cpp

and the managed drawing implementation under
src/Geometrikal.OpenCV.Managed/ImgProc/Drawing/ is a C# port of
the OpenCV implementation in:

  - modules/imgproc/src/drawing.cpp

and the managed morphology and border implementation under
src/Geometrikal.OpenCV.Managed/ImgProc/Morphology/ and
src/Geometrikal.OpenCV.Managed/Core/Borders.cs is a C# port of
the OpenCV implementation in:

  - modules/imgproc/src/morph.dispatch.cpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/morph.simd.hpp
  - modules/core/src/copy.cpp (borderInterpolate, copyMakeBorder, scalarToRawData)

and the managed filtering implementation under
src/Geometrikal.OpenCV.Managed/ImgProc/Filtering/ is a C# port of
the OpenCV implementation in:

  - modules/imgproc/src/filter.dispatch.cpp / filter.simd.hpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/box_filter.dispatch.cpp / box_filter.simd.hpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/smooth.dispatch.cpp / smooth.simd.hpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/median_blur.dispatch.cpp / median_blur.simd.hpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/fixedpoint.inl.hpp
  - modules/imgproc/src/deriv.cpp
  - modules/core/src/softfloat.cpp (f64_exp; the median histogram code also
    incorporates the constant-time median filtering idea contributed to
    OpenCV by Simon Perreault)

and the managed core operations under
src/Geometrikal.OpenCV.Managed/Core/ (Arithmetic, Bitwise,
Comparison, Conversions, Reductions and Mat masking) are a C# port of the
OpenCV implementation in:

  - modules/core/src/arithm.cpp / arithm.simd.hpp
  - modules/core/src/copy.cpp (copyTo, setTo, convertAndUnrollScalar)
  - modules/core/src/convert.dispatch.cpp / convert.simd.hpp
  - modules/core/src/convert_scale.dispatch.cpp / convert_scale.simd.hpp
  - modules/core/src/split.dispatch.cpp, merge.dispatch.cpp, lut.cpp
  - modules/core/src/sum.dispatch.cpp, mean.dispatch.cpp, minmax.dispatch.cpp,
    count_non_zero.dispatch.cpp, norm.dispatch.cpp / norm.simd.hpp
  - modules/core/src/matrix_operations.cpp (reduce), matmul.dispatch.cpp
    (scaleAdd)
  - modules/geometry/src/geometry.cpp (intersectConvexConvex), intersection.cpp
    (rotatedRectangleIntersection)
  - modules/photo/src/denoising.cpp, fast_nlmeans_denoising_invoker.hpp,
    fast_nlmeans_denoising_invoker_commons.hpp (fastNlMeansDenoising)
  - modules/core/src/dxt.cpp (divSpectrums); modules/imgproc/src/blend.cpp (blendLinear)
  - modules/photo/src/inpaint.cpp (inpaint)
  - modules/imgproc/src/demosaicing.cpp (demosaicing: bilinear, VNG, edge-aware)
  - modules/imgproc/src/accum.cpp, accum.simd.hpp (accumulate, accumulateSquare,
    accumulateProduct, accumulateWeighted)
  - modules/imgproc/src/imgwarp.cpp (warpPolar)
  - modules/imgproc/src/hough.cpp (HoughLines, HoughLinesP, HoughLinesPointSet,
    HoughCircles HOUGH_GRADIENT)
  - modules/core/src/mathfuncs.cpp (magnitude, phase, cartToPolar, polarToCart,
    exp, log, pow, sqrt) and mathfuncs_core.simd.hpp; hal/intrin_math.hpp
    (v_sincos_default_32f) and hal/intrin_sse.hpp (v_invsqrt)

